  "description": "Test build of Annie as in League (needs League of Legends Heroes): replaces the main pack's Annie. Disintegrate: a fireball that kills its target (minion, monster or champion) refunds half of Q's cooldown (the main pack's has no refund, since data cannot cut a cooldown on a kill; Annie has no mana here, so only the cooldown comes back). Tibbers (0.3.0): a unit of his own through the mod API's spawn_unit - he lands where the main pack's drop lands, then walks, attacks (12 + 7% of her ability power a hit), burns enemies round him every second (7 + 4%), can be killed and lasts 8 seconds (the main pack's Tibbers is pictures and burns riding on the target for 6); a host that gives no unit keeps him riding on the target, going on to the nearest enemy champion when it dies. Needs the main pack's sheet league/champions/league_annie_tibbers. Other champions are untouched. Writes a log for testing.",
  "last_updated": "2026-11-14",
  "mod_id": "league_annie_q",
  "mod_type": "native",
  "name": "League Heroes: Annie's Disintegrate refund and Tibbers as a unit (test)",
  "version": "0.3.0"
}
